      "doc": "doc_1",
      "category": "src_content",
      "full_page": "I hope you are well. I've tried a number of times to start this card; now its 10:15 P.M. Was just talking with Mary. She is in great hopes that you will succeed in getting \"Mother and Dad Jim\" for a trip East. I think it would give (Jim at least) them another lease of ten yrs ....... Be sure and write them I said so. I've been wanting to write them so long. Have about sixty letters ahead to answer. .. Well! Well: so Annie O Brien is to celebrate her golden Wed'g. I remember her quite well - knew before she was married. I surely will remember them in Mass tomorrow.",
      "per_polygon": "I hope you are well. I've tried a number of times to start this card; now its 10:15 P.M. Was just talking with Mary. She is in great hopes that you will succeed in getting \"Mother and Dad Jim\" for a trip East. I think it would give (Jim at least) them another lease of ten yrs. Be sure and write them I said so. I've been wanting to write them so long. Have about sixty letters ahead to answer. Well! Well: so Annie O Brien is to celebrate her golden Wed'g. I remember her quite well - knew before she was married. I surely will remember them in Mass tomorrow",
